    "answer": "Do not replace the pump. A retest performed while inlet pressure is below 4 bar does not satisfy the replacement prerequisite. Restore inlet pressure to at least 4 bar to rule out the environmental low-supply cause, then retest again; replace only if E42 persists after retesting with adequate inlet pressure."
