    "answer": "Do not replace the pump yet. Exactly 4.0 bar meets the at-least-4-bar threshold, but the rule also requires E42 to persist after retesting. Confirm the inlet pressure remains stable at or above 4 bar so low inlet supply is ruled out, then retest; replace only if E42 persists after that retest."
