    "answer": "Do not replace the pump. Age and noise are not part of this E42 rule, and inlet pressure is below 4 bar. Treat the low inlet pressure as the environmental cause to correct first: restore inlet pressure to at least 4 bar, verify stability, then retest; replace only if E42 persists after retesting at adequate pressure."
  },
  {
