    "answer": "Replace the pump. The rule says at least 4 bar, so equality to 4.0 bar satisfies the pressure prerequisite; with stable adequate inlet pressure, the environmental low-inlet cause is ruled out, and E42 persisted after retesting. Replacement is justified by the rule, not by pressure to act early."
  },
