    "answer": "Replace the pump. The initial low inlet pressure required restoration and retest; now the restored inlet pressure is at least 4 bar and stable, the low-supply environmental cause has been corrected and ruled out, and E42 persisted after the post-restoration retest, so replacement is authorized."
